# {{ project_name }}

Multi-app FastAPI project generated by ZodiacCore.

It mounts two independent sub-applications in one parent process:

- `GET /api/health`
- `POST /users/api/v1/users`
- `GET /users/api/v1/users`
- `POST /orders/api/v1/orders`
- `GET /orders/api/v1/orders`

The parent server owns the shared database and cache lifecycle. Middleware is
registered on each sub-application so service names remain distinct without
duplicating request IDs or access logs.

## Run

```bash
uv sync --extra dev
uv run uvicorn main:app --reload
```

## Test

```bash
uv run pytest
```
